  "verdict": "Testable, but only for a large effect. An 8-week geo holdout that switches off 2 of 6 usable metros (28% of scope spend) can see the drop only if at least 47% of the conversions Google credits there are truly incremental. That only just clears the default 50% threshold: a 'no effect' read would rule out incrementality above about 47%, but couldn't tell 'a third are real' from 'none are real'.",
